# Project instructions

## Harness workflow

- Use `/plan` when scope, risks, or acceptance criteria are not settled.
- Use `/work` for one approved implementation phase.
- Use `/review` for one independent four-lens review.
- Use `/release` only when the user asks to prepare a reviewed change for delivery.
- Use `/orchestrator` for non-trivial end-to-end coordination and at most three review attempts including the first.

Small changes stay in the main conversation. Tester and documenter agents are optional. Repository-specific rules and commands belong below this section; do not duplicate the agent prompt files here.

